Rule 3 (breakpoints as a tensor must be within the valid index range of the detrend axis)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : tensor} |= if v_2 ≥ 0 then min(v_3) ≥ 0 ∧ max(v_3) < shape(v_1, v_2) else min(v_3) ≥ 0 ∧ max(v_3) < shape(v_1, v_2 + ndim(v_1))
