Rule 4 (breakpoints as a list of integers must be within the valid index range of the detrend axis)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : list(int)} |= if v_2 ≥ 0 then (∀i ∈ [0, v_3.len - 1] : v_3[i] ≥ 0 ∧ v_3[i] < shape(v_1, v_2)) else (∀i ∈ [0, v_3.len - 1] : v_3[i] ≥ 0 ∧ v_3[i] < shape(v_1, v_2 + ndim(v_1)))
