Rule 13 (the size of the input tensor along the detrend axis must be at least 2)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ 0 then shape(v_1, v_2) ≥ 2 else shape(v_1, v_2 + ndim(v_1)) ≥ 2
